{"id":"stmt:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-01","source":"source:sato2009","asset":"asset:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces","locator":{"leaf":6,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"条件表現の後に諾否疑問文が現れる確実な例は今のところ見いだされていない","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":6},"statement":{"en":"In Ainu, no reliable examples have been found so far where a yes-no question appears following a conditional expression.","ja":"アイヌ語において、条件表現の後に諾否疑問文が現れる確実な例は今のところ見いだされていない。"},"type":"absence","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":[],"topics":["topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses","topic:discourse/interrogative-strategies-question-particles","topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--overview"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/sato2009/2026-09-10T14-36-38-832Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"条件表現の後に諾否疑問文が現れる確実な例は今のところ見いだされていない。","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--overview","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-02","source":"source:sato2009","asset":"asset:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces","locator":{"leaf":6,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"「判断のレベル」に属する条件表現とされる日本語の「ナラ」に当たるような専用の形式もないようである","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":6},"statement":{"en":"There appears to be no dedicated conditional form in Ainu corresponding to Japanese nara, which belongs to the level of judgment.","ja":"アイヌ語には、「判断のレベル」に属する条件表現とされる日本語の「ナラ」に当たるような専用の形式もないようである。"},"type":"absence","stance":"proposes","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":[],"topics":["topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses","topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--overview"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/sato2009/2026-09-10T14-36-38-832Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"「判断のレベル」に属する条件表現とされる日本語の「ナラ」に当たるような専用の形式もないようである。","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--overview","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-03","source":"source:sato2009","asset":"asset:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces","locator":{"leaf":6,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"in Ainu, some conditional expressions require the interrogative and imperative modal expressions only, so the epistemic mood does not necessarily play a crucial role","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":6},"statement":{"en":"In Ainu, some conditional expressions require only interrogative and imperative modal expressions in the main clause, so epistemic mood does not necessarily play a crucial role.","ja":"アイヌ語では一部の条件表現が疑問および命令のモダリティ表現のみを要求するため、認識的モダリティが必ずしも決定的な役割を果たさない。"},"type":"distribution","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":[],"topics":["topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses","topic:tam/epistemic-irrealis-modality","topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--mood-constraint"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/sato2009/2026-09-10T14-36-38-832Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"in Ainu, some conditional expressions require the interrogative and imperative modal expressions only, so the epistemic mood does not necessarily play a crucial role.","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--mood-constraint","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-04","source":"source:sato2009","asset":"asset:sato2009@pdftotext-pieces","locator":{"leaf":6,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"yakun is the most important among the Ainu conditional expressions since it has extremely wider usage corresponding to that of at least three different conditional expressions of Japanese","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":6},"statement":{"en":"The connective yakun has an exceptionally broad range of usage among Ainu conditional expressions, corresponding to at least three different conditional expressions in Japanese.","ja":"アイヌ語の条件表現の中で yakun は日本語の少なくとも3つの異なる条件表現に相当する極めて広い用法を持つ。"},"type":"form-function","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["yakun"],"topics":["topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses","topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--yakun"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/sato2009/2026-09-10T14-36-38-832Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"yakun is the most important among the Ainu conditional expressions since it has extremely wider usage corresponding to that of at least three different conditional expressions of Japanese.","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses--yakun","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
